  dialogs:
  - name: Perfectionism
    dialog: DONT TOUCH THAT!!!
  - name: Burnout
    dialog: ...tired...
  - name: Burnout
    dialog: why... keep going...
  - name: Burnout
    dialog: just... rest...
  - name: Perfectionism
    dialog: I know it's heavy, Founder.
  - name: Perfectionism
    dialog: But we don't stop. Not now. Not when it's finally taking shape.
  - name: Perfectionism
    dialog: Push through. The work needs it. So do I.
  - name: Perfectionism
    dialog: If we give up now, we gonna fall into mediocrity
